            "review_title": "Review at Hoi- Modern Vegetarian Dining",
            "review_text": "Ron Ka\nUnited States6 contributions\n0\nAwesome Vegetarian food. One of the best I have ever eaten anywhere in the world\nFeb 2026 • Family\nAn amazing must visit restaurant in Hanoi. \n\nThe buffet is unique and extensive with so many many fusion vegetarian dishes and authentic vietnamese dishes.\n\nNo fake meat.\n\nI’d recommend getting a good appetite before going there. Amazing quality and quantity of food.\n\nUnlimited buffet. Select items from the sumptuous menu and each item is delivered as you order to the table. \n\nI have traveled extensively worldwide. This is one of the best.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 18, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
