            "review_title": "Review at Hoi- Modern Vegetarian Dining",
            "review_text": "Debbie Stan\nSheffield, United Kingdom68 contributions\n0\nExcellent vegetarian restaurant\nAug 2024 • Family\nThis is a fantastic vegetarian restaurant in Ha Long Bay. The food is visually beautiful and cooked to perfection. There was lots of choice on the menu and everything we ordered tasted amazing. They didn’t sell alcohol but this didn’t matter there were loads of soft drinks on the menu, and iced water. The staff were very friendly and service was excellent. It’s a beautiful restaurant inside with a lovely atmosphere. There was 6 of us adults and the bill was roughly £40. An absolute bargain and we will probably go back.\nInsider tip:\nGo early evening as the place was very busy. Not to be missed.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 26, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
