            "review_title": "Review at Hoi- Modern Vegetarian Dining",
            "review_text": "Andrey Partizan\nSortavala, Russia78 contributions\n0\nAuthentic, calm place with beautiful presentation of food\nMay 2024 • Solo\nThe staff is very polite and the establishment itself is authentic. I tried different dishes. I can't say I'm delighted with the taste. Many menu items were not available. I think this is due to the fact that it is low season and there are few tourists. But the presentation is masterpiece. I didn’t even want to eat coconut soup or sashimi so as not to break the composition on the plate. The menu is very interesting, it’s like a separate form of art. Impressed.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten May 31, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
